@segment 45-48 Feralas, The Hinterlands, Tanaris II & Blasted Lands
@start-level 45
@carry 1262,864,2874,648,3520
@done 82,351,654,1261,1435,2873

# Carried in from segment 16: 1262 Report to Zor (Orgrimmar), 864 Return to Apothecary Zinge (Undercity),
# 2874 Deliver to MacKinley and 648 Rescue OOX-17/TN (Booty Bay), 3520 Screecher Spirits (Feralas, back to Yeh'kinya after the Tooga escort).
# Order: Gadgetzan -> Camp Mojache (Feralas I) -> Orgrimmar -> Feralas -> Gadgetzan (Tanaris II) -> Undercity -> Tarren Mill ->
# The Hinterlands -> Gadgetzan -> Feralas II -> Thunder Bluff -> Ratchet -> Booty Bay -> Stonard -> Blasted Lands -> Stonard.
# Tanaris II comes before the Hinterlands (PLAN had it after) because Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient (2641) is picked up in Gadgetzan
# and its Violet Tragan grows in a Hinterlands lake. Its mobs are 47-50, so the route grinds to 47 at the Dunemaul Compound first.
# The Orgrimmar stop is merged into the Neeru Fireblade trip (3121/3122) and also hands in the Feralas I follow-ups 2976, 3002 and 7732.
# 864 is handed in on the Undercity stop before the Hinterlands.
# Carried out to segment 18: 32, 81 (Orgrimmar), 2782, 2995 (Undercity), 2741 (Egg-O-Matic in Gadgetzan), 2622 (Stonard).
# Left out of PLAN's list: 2933/2934 (two extra Tarren Mill trips, chain ends in elite 2935), 4120 (Felwood kills), 7842 (scattered gryphons),
# 1429/1444 (need elite 1424). Added: 3721 An OOX of Your Own (Booty Bay, no objectives, 7100 XP once 648/836/2767 are done) and
# 2741 The Super Egg-O-Matic (Forever made it level 47, 4200 XP; the egg lies in the Frayfeather Highlands on the Feralas II loop).

# ---------- Gadgetzan -> Camp Mojache ----------
N Buy 4-5 Runes of Teleportation before you leave a city | This segment uses Teleport: Orgrimmar, Undercity and Thunder Bluff once each. No Teleport spells yet? The fallback travel is given at each step.
FLY Freewind Post | You start in Gadgetzan. Take the wind rider to Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.
N Follow the road west out of Thousand Needles into Feralas; it leads to Camp Mojache | About 5 minutes on your mount. The camp sits on the hills in eastern Feralas.
F Camp Mojache @ Feralas, 75.4, 44.3 | Shyn, the wind rider master
S Camp Mojache | Innkeeper Greul
A 2862 | Hadoken Swiftstrider
A 2822 | Jangdor Swiftstrider
A 2973 | Krueg Skullsplitter
A 2975 | Rok Orhan
A 2987 | Orwin Gizzmick
A 3121 | Witch Doctor Uzer'i. You hand the shrunken head in at Orgrimmar later in this segment.
N Keep any OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon that drops in Feralas | It starts Find OOX-22/FE!, which you do on your second Feralas visit.

# ---------- Feralas I: first loop ----------
C 2862,2973 @ Feralas, 70.0, 47.0 | The hills just west and south-west of Camp Mojache. Woodpaw Mongrels, Trappers and Brutes drop the manes; Sprite Darters flit over the same slopes and drop the wings.
C 2975,2987 @ Feralas, 76.5, 31.0 | Ride north to the Gordunni Outpost. Kill Gordunni Ogres, Ogre Mages and Brutes; click the Gordunni Dirt Mounds around the huts for the cobalt. Frost Nova + Blizzard works well on the ogre packs.
A 2978 @ Feralas, 74.5, 27.9 | A Gordunni Scroll lies on the ground in the outpost (also at 75.1, 29.7 and 80.5, 34.3). Pick it up and read it.
T 2862 | Back in Camp Mojache: Hadoken Swiftstrider
A 2863 | Hadoken Swiftstrider. One hour timer: start it only when you are ready to go south.
T 2973 | Krueg Skullsplitter
A 2974 | Krueg Skullsplitter
T 2975,2978 | Rok Orhan
A 2980,2979 | Rok Orhan
T 2987 | Orwin Gizzmick

# ---------- Feralas I: Grimtotem and Woodpaw ----------
C 2974 @ Feralas, 68.0, 42.0 | The Grimtotem Compound in the hills just west of the camp: Grimtotem Raiders, Naturalists and Shamans drop the horns.
C 2863 @ Feralas, 70.4, 54.7 | Ride south to the big Woodpaw camps. Woodpaw Alphas walk among the Mystics and Reavers.
T 2974 | Krueg Skullsplitter
A 2976 | Krueg Skullsplitter. He gives you a crate of horns for Belgrom Rockmaul; you hand it in on the Orgrimmar stop below.
T 2863 | Hadoken Swiftstrider
A 2902 | Hadoken Swiftstrider

# ---------- Feralas I: the south ----------
T 2902 | The Woodpaw Battle Map lies in the gnoll camp at 71.6, 55.9
A 2903 | From the same map
C 2980,2979 @ Feralas, 60.5, 66.0 | Ride south-west to the Ruins of Isildien. Gordunni Maulers stand at the north edge; Shaman and Warlocks fill the ruins. The Gordunni Orb drops from the Gordunni Mage-Lords in the southern part (around 60, 70).
C 3520 @ Feralas, 57.5, 57.0 | Screecher Spirits, on the way north-west: Vale Screechers walk the slopes between the ruins and Feral Scar Vale (57-60, 55-62), and Rogue Vale Screechers roam around the vale and north of it (48-56, 47-59). Kill one, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on the corpse, then click the spirit that appears. You need three.
C 2822 @ Feralas, 53.5, 57.0 | Ride west to Feral Scar Vale. Feral Scar Yetis and their Enraged and Hulking kin drop the Thick Yeti Hides.
T 2903 | Back in Camp Mojache: Hadoken Swiftstrider
A 7730,7731 | Hadoken Swiftstrider
T 2980,2979 | Rok Orhan
A 3002 | Rok Orhan. The orb goes to Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar, on the Orgrimmar stop below.
T 2822 | Jangdor Swiftstrider. Leave his next quest, Improved Quality, until your second visit.
C 7730,7731 @ Feralas, 75.5, 63.0 | The Writhing Deep, the silithid hive south of the Woodpaw camps. Every Zukk'ash bug drops carapaces. Stinglasher is a big wasp that flies around the east side of the hive (around 77, 62).
L 46 @ Feralas, 75.5, 63.0 | Quest XP runs short here. Keep killing Zukk'ash Workers, Wasps and Tunnelers in the hive until level 46.
T 7730,7731 | Hadoken Swiftstrider
A 7732 | Hadoken Swiftstrider. The report goes to Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar, on the Orgrimmar stop below.

# ---------- Orgrimmar ----------
