# ---------- Tanaris II ----------
S Gadgetzan | Innkeeper Fizzgrimble. You hearth back here from the Hinterlands.
A 10 | Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
A 5863 | Andi Lynn
A 2605 | Marin Noggenfogger
A 3362 | Tran'rek
C 10 @ Tanaris, 56.0, 71.2 | Ride south to the Gaping Chasm. Scrimshank's Surveying Gear lies inside the silithid hive; clear the bugs at the entrance as you go in.
L 47 @ Tanaris, 40.5, 58.0 | Ride west to the Dunemaul Compound. The Tanaris mobs from here on are 47-50, so grind the Dunemaul Brutes and Enforcers here until level 47. Pull them in twos and threes; Frost Nova and step back. These kills count for The Dunemaul Compound.
C 5863 @ Tanaris, 40.5, 58.0 | Finish the 10 Dunemaul Brutes and 10 Enforcers, then kill Gor'marok the Ravager (level 49), who stands near the middle at 41.5, 57.8.
C 2605,3362 @ Tanaris, 29.3, 65.5 | Thistleshrub Valley, the cactus garden south-west of the compound. Thistleshrub Dew Collectors drop the gland; Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers (48-50) are the kill targets. Pull them one at a time.
A 1560 | Tooga the turtle sits at the south end of the valley (31.8, 74.1). Accept it only when the rest of the valley is done.
C 1560 @ Tanaris, 66.6, 25.7 | 30-minute timer: go straight to Torta, with no detours and no extra pulls. Lead Tooga north-east across the desert to his wife Torta, just south of Steamwheedle Port. He follows you; stay on foot, keep him close and kill anything that attacks him.
T 1560 | Torta
T 3520 | Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port, just north of Torta. Skip his next quest, The Prophecy of Mosh'aru: it needs Zul'Farrak.
T 10 | Back in Gadgetzan: Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
A 110 | Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
T 110 | Alchemist Pestlezugg
A 113 | Alchemist Pestlezugg
T 113 | Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser. He offers Rise of the Silithid next: leave it until you are back in Gadgetzan after the Hinterlands.
T 5863 | Andi Lynn
T 3362 | Tran'rek
T 2605 | Marin Noggenfogger
A 2606 | Marin Noggenfogger
T 2606 | Sprinkle, a few steps away
A 2641 | Sprinkle. The Violet Tragan grows under water in a small Hinterlands lake.

# ---------- Undercity and Tarren Mill ----------
N Teleport: Undercity (or fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades if you don't have it)
A 2995 | Oran Snakewrithe in the Magic Quarter
T 864 | Apothecary Zinge in the Apothecarium
