N Ride east out of Tarren Mill on the road into the Hinterlands | Go around Aerie Peak: it is an Alliance town with guards.

# ---------- The Hinterlands: west, then east to Revantusk ----------
T 650 | Gilveradin Sunchaser camps just south-west of Quel'Danil Lodge (26.7, 48.6). Leave the Venom Bottles in the Witherbark village to the south: that chain needs two extra Tarren Mill trips and ends in an elite quest.
A 77 | Gilveradin Sunchaser. Leave Quel'Danil Lodge, the elf lodge just north-east, alone for now: you clear it once Message to the Wildhammer from Revantusk is in your log.
C 3123 @ The Hinterlands, 40.0, 47.0 | Ride east along the road. Vicious and Primitive Owlbeasts roam the hills on both sides of it (around 35-46, 43-56). Kill 10 and use the Muisek Vessel on each corpse. Loot them all for Resilient Sinew and Metallic Fragments (Natural Materials).
C 77 @ The Hinterlands, 57.0, 41.5 | Follow the road east to Skulk Rock. Loot the Horde Supply Crates around the old Horde camp there. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes guard them.
F Revantusk Village @ The Hinterlands, 81.7, 81.8 | Keep following the road south-east to Revantusk Village on the coast. Gorkas, the wind rider master
A 7828,7829,7830 | Huntsman Markhor
A 7839 | Smith Slagtree
A 7840 | Lard
A 7841 | Otho Moji'ko. Skip the Revantusk elite quests (Gammerita, Separation Anxiety, Dark Vessels, Kidnapped Elder Torntusk, the Call to Arms board).
A 7844 | Mystic Yayo'jin
A 7815 | Katoom the Angler

# ---------- The Hinterlands: big loop ----------
C 7828:1,7829,7830 @ The Hinterlands, 60.0, 50.0 | Ride north-west into the central wilds. Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and the Razorbeak Skylords (one circles near 54, 49, another near 64, 52) all live here. Keep looting owlbeasts for sinew and fragments; Savage Owlbeasts also count for the Muisek Vessel if you are still short.
C 7844 @ The Hinterlands, 47.5, 66.0 | Ride south-west to the Altar of Zul. Vilebranch Scalpers and Soothsayers camp around it. More Scalpers stand at Agol'watha (53, 40) and Shaol'watha (70, 48) later on the loop.
C 2641 @ The Hinterlands, 40.6, 59.7 | The small lake just west of the Altar. Swim to the bottom and pick a Violet Tragan mushroom.
C 7828:2 @ The Hinterlands, 43.0, 54.0 | Silvermane Howlers roam the hills around the lake. Loot the Primitive Owlbeasts here for sinew and fragments too.
C 7841,2995 @ The Hinterlands, 31.5, 47.5 | Back at Quel'Danil Lodge: kill 15 of each kind of Highvale elf and burn the three Highvale documents, the Records (32.0, 46.8), the Notes (29.6, 48.7) and the Report (28.6, 46.0). The elves respawn while you work; Blizzard the groups.
A 2742 | Rin'ji is held inside the lodge (30.7, 46.9). Accept once the lodge is cleared: he starts walking out straight away.
C 2742 @ The Hinterlands, 30.7, 46.9 | Escort Rin'ji out of the lodge. Frost Nova anything that jumps him and keep him alive. His secret is far to the east; you pick it up later.
T 77 | Gilveradin Sunchaser
A 81 @ The Hinterlands, 26.7, 48.6 | Gilveradin Sunchaser. You hand the barrel in at Orgrimmar in the next segment.
C 7839 @ The Hinterlands, 53.4, 38.7 | Ride back east. Slagtree's Lost Tools lie at one of five Vilebranch spots. Check the two near the robot first: Agol'watha (53.4, 38.7) and Skulk Rock (57.4, 42.5).
A 485 @ The Hinterlands, 49.4, 37.7 | Right-click the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon. The robot lies at the head of the river just west of Agol'watha. No beacon yet? Kill the oozes at Skulk Rock (57, 42) and the Vilebranch at Agol'watha (53, 39) until one drops: Find OOX-09, Rescue OOX-09 and An OOX of Your Own are worth about 17,000 XP together.
T 485 | Homing Robot OOX-09/HL
A 836 | Homing Robot OOX-09/HL
C 836 @ The Hinterlands, 84.0, 58.0 | Escort the robot east to the shore below the Overlook Cliffs. Kill the ambushers quickly.
C 7840 @ The Hinterlands, 84.5, 41.2 | Ride north along the coast to Lard's island, just offshore. Click Lard's Picnic Basket; the Vilebranch Kidnappers that show up carry the lunch.
C 7839 @ The Hinterlands, 71.0, 48.7 | Tools not found yet? Check the three Shaol'watha spots on your way back south: 66.4, 44.8; 71.0, 48.7; 72.5, 52.9.
T 2742 @ The Hinterlands, 86.3, 59.0 | Ride south-east to the Overlook Cliffs. Rin'ji's Secret is a tablet on the cliff top.
A 2782 | Take the tablet. You hand it to Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity in the next segment.
C 7815 @ The Hinterlands, 81.0, 62.0 | Saltwater Snapjaws crawl along this whole coast. Kill them along the shore, then follow it south to Revantusk.
T 7828,7829,7830 | Back in Revantusk: Huntsman Markhor
T 7839 | Smith Slagtree
T 7840 | Lard
T 7841 | Otho Moji'ko. Skip Another Message to the Wildhammer: the gryphons it needs are too spread out.
T 7844 | Mystic Yayo'jin
T 7815 | Katoom the Angler
H Gadgetzan | Hearthstone on cooldown? Teleport: Thunder Bluff and fly to Gadgetzan.

