C 3124,3128:3,3128:4 @ Feralas, 55.5, 67.0 | Ride south-west to the Frayfeather Highlands. Kill Frayfeather Hippogryphs, Stagwings, Skystormers or Patriarchs and use the Muisek Vessel on each corpse. Loot them all: stay until you also have 20 Resilient Sinew and 40 Metallic Fragments for Natural Materials (the Hinterlands owlbeasts gave you part of them).
C 2741 @ Feralas, 57.3, 77.0 | Ride a little further south. Hippogryph Eggs lie in the nests at the south end of the Frayfeather Highlands; take one. Frayfeather Patriarchs guard them.
