A 3125 | Witch Doctor Uzer'i
C 3125,3128:2 @ Feralas, 68.0, 47.5 | Sprite Darters in the hills just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one. They also drop the Encrusted Minerals.
T 3125 | Witch Doctor Uzer'i
A 3126 | Witch Doctor Uzer'i. Wandering Forest Walkers are big treants that roam alone; you need three, and they also drop the Splintered Logs. Kill every one you meet on the coming loop.
A 2766 @ Feralas, 53.4, 55.7 | Ride west. On the way, kill the Forest Walkers that roam near the Grimtotem Compound (74, 39) and in central Feralas (54, 47). Right-click the OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon: the robot is in a small cave at the edge of Feral Scar Vale. No beacon yet? Kill the Feral Scar yetis around the cave and the Vale Screechers on the slopes east of it until one drops: this robot pair and An OOX of Your Own are worth about 16,000 XP together.
T 2766 | Homing Robot OOX-22/FE
A 2767 | Homing Robot OOX-22/FE
C 2767 @ Feralas, 45.0, 43.0 | Escort the robot west to the dock on the Forgotten Coast. Kill the ambushers fast.
A 7003,7721 | Zorbin Fandazzle at the dock (44.8, 43.4)
C 7003,7721 @ Feralas, 42.5, 49.0 | Along the coast: Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays drop the cores. Zap the Shore, Wave and Deep Striders with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker, then kill the small zapped giants for the residue.
T 7003,7721 | Zorbin Fandazzle. Skip his repeat versions.
C 3063 @ Feralas, 39.5, 13.5 | Ride north up the coast to the Northspring harpy nests. Kill 4 of each kind.
C 3126,3128:1 @ Feralas, 44.0, 23.0 | A Forest Walker roams the hills south-east of the harpies. Still short of three? The last one wanders the south near the Frayfeather Highlands (57, 73).
C 7734 @ Feralas, 53.5, 31.5 | Ride east to Rage Scar Hold. Rage Scar Yetis drop the hides. If a Perfect Yeti Hide drops, right-click it and hand it to Jangdor too.
